  unitName: Calm Triumph Zekuu
  unitId: 61056
  unitNumber: 1517
  description: An otherworldly swordsman who appeared from nowhere at the Grand Gaia
    Arena in the land of Atharva, long before the war between humanity and the gods.
    He fought with overwhelming strength, and won a victory over Zektasa, the dominant
    team at the time. Afterwards, he gave in to popular demand and fought a rematch
    with them. The ensuing battle was unprecedented, and led to the formation of
    a dimensional rift. The Arena was destroyed, and he vanished amidst the chaos.
    Some witnesses claim they saw him sucked into the rift, but the truth remains
    unclear.
  summonDesc: Stop interfering.<br>I have somewhere to be.
  fusionDesc: It's pointless...<br>I only have one goal.
